  <para style="h">2 Thimothi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo Gwebubili gwaPhawuli ekwalila THIMOTHI</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Thimothi</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Thim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo Gwebubili gwaPhawuli ekwalila</para>
  <para style="mt1">THIMOTHI</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lukwalo gwebubili gwaThimothi</char> Lukwalo gwebubili Phawuli gwaakakwalila ndhiyiwa uwe Thimothi. Lukwalo gwaThimothi gwebubili gwakakwagwa koyenda kubupelo gwebupenyu gwaPhawuli. Mulubaka igogo Phawuli waka elinsungwa kuRoma (2 Thimothi 1.16). Phawuli waka ewhisisana kwazo naThimothi lubaka gunjinji waka ewunti unkololo uwe (BaFilipi. 2.22, 1 Thimothi 1.2, 1 Thimothi 1.18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Igogu lukwalo gudzimwe dzewhalo nna dzakakwagwa naPhawuli dziyenda kunhu dzisingayende kugubungano. Dzimwe whalo nhatu ndiyedzi Thimothi wekutanga; Thayithasi naFilimoni. Mulubaka kukwagwa lukwalo gwaThimothi gwebubili maKhirisitu aka egala kuRoma aka edziyidziwa kwazo. Kokumbuligwa kuti Phawuli waka elimujele ngentha yedziyidziwa ikoku kakale kungentha yayikoku dziyidziwa kwakathama kuti akuludzile Thimothi kuti asimidzile mubulemo. Semulukwalo gwaThimothi gwekutanga, Phawuli unotjenjedza Thimothi nekwebadiyi bemanyepwa (1 Thimothi 1.16-18). Kakale unobudza Thimothi kuti kowhohha lubaka gwakasima kwazo (1 Thimothi 3.1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongoloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unotanga nebuyisa Thimothi (2 Thimothi 1.1-2) unoyendela mbeli ewukuludzila (2 Thimothi 1.3-18).</para>
  <para style="io1">Unowukuludzila kuti abenhu unosimidzila mubulemo (2 Thimothi 2.1-13).</para>
  <para style="io1">Unotobela uwunlaya nekwezwaanofanila thama (2 Thimothi 2.14-26).</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unotjenjedza Thimothi nekwezwinhu zwinowhoyetika mumahhuba anotobela kakale ewumbudza nekwezila yaangasumikila nayo mumamo akajalo (2 Thimothi 3.1-4.8).</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unopedzisila neleba nezwakalingisana naThimothi tjekukwe (2 Thimothi 4.9-24)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Kubva kunaPhawuli, mpositoli waKhirisitu Yesu ngentha yekuda kweNdzimu, nange kuyendidzana netjigadzabgwe tjebutjilo gumuna Khirisitu Yesu.<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Kuna Thimothi nkololo wangu wandinoda kwazo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Ngoni, nemawhilangoni, nekunyalala kunobva kuNdzimu ibo Tate naKhirisitu Yesu He wedu ngakube kukuli.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boka neKuludzila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Ndoboka Ndzimu wandinohingila nehana mbuyanana, sekwakakuthama bobatategulu bangu, ndikukumbula lubaka gose mumitembezelo yangu. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Hapa ndikumbula mihodzi iyo, ndoyemula siku nesikati kuti kadzene ndandakubona, kuyetila kuti ndihhale kuhanha. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Ndokumbula bugalimoyo gugo gwemalebeswa, bugalimoyo gwakatanga ba munakuku babo Loyisi nameyabo Yunisi koga kwangwenu ndinamalebeswa kuti gwatjibabo mukuli. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Nentha yayikoku ndokukumbudza kuti umusidzile tjipo tjeNdzimu tjimukuli tjakahha ngekukubiga maboko angu, <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />ngobe Ndzimu azotipa meya yehla, koga wakatipa meya yemasimba, neludo, nezwidziba.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Usibe nehoni nepa busupi nekwaHe wedu, kene nekwangu imi nsungwa uwe, koga bhatana nami mukudziyilila ndebo mbuya ngemasimba eNdzimu, <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />iye wakatitjidza kakale akatidana nedana kwakayengemala, kusi ngentha yemihingo yedu, koga kuli ngentha yetjinangwa tjitje nange ngoni dzaakatipa munaKhirisitu Yesu ntolo ntolo, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />kwatjizumbunugwa ngwenuwali ngentha yebonekwa kweNtjidzi wedu Khirisitu Yesu, iye wakadusa lufu akahhisa bupenyu nesafa kutjedza ngendebo mbuya.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Kungentha yendebo mbuya iyeyi ndakagadziwa kuti ndibe nsumikili nempositoli nendhiyi, <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />ndizo ndidziyila nayeyi zila, koga andinahoni, ngobe ndoziba wandakagalamoyo muwunli, kakale ndinalebeswa kuti unotubula londolodza tjandakapiwa kudzina kunoswika ilelo Hhuba. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Bhatilila mumatama akwako awakawha kubva kundili, anakugalamoyo neludo muna Khirisitu Yesu, <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />londolodza lebeswa lawakapiwa neMeya Yakayengemala inogala mutili.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Nokuziba kuti bose bamuAsiya kose naPhegelasi naHemogenesi bakandifupatila. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Kadzene He bangaba nemawhilangoni kun'ha waOnesiforasi, ngobe wakandisimisa kanjinji, azotongoba nehoni nekweketane dzangu, <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />wakati aswika muRoma akandihaka nemoyo uwe wose akadzina akandiwana, <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />kadzene He bangakuthama kuti awamutjile mawhilangoni anobva kuna He muHhuba ilelo! Iwe noziba kuti wakandibhata zwakanaka kungapani kuEfesu.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Nghwi Wengwa WaKhirisitu Yesu Unogalikabgwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Iwe ke nkololo wangu sima mungoni dzimunaKhirisitu Yesu, <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />kakale kose kwawakawha kubva kundili mbeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kungalebabo kuti zwinhu izwezwi zwakatshinidzigwa nebasupi banjinji</char></note> kwebasupi banjinji ukupindisile kubanhu banogalikabgwe banowhotubula diya bamwe.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Dziyila bo senghwi mbuya wengwa waKhirisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Akuna nghwi wengwa umun'hingo unozwimanikanya nezwinhu zwebutjilo gwemahhuba ose, ngobe unoba ehaka hanhisa iwhoya wakawumpa n'hingo wekuti abe nghwi wengwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Nlabuki atopiwa tjiyala kuhhe kwekuti alondolodza milayo yelabuka. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Nlimi unohinga zwakabangalala ndiye wakafanila tanga wana gobe lezwidlo. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Ukumbule nekwetjandinoleba, ngobe He unowhokuyeta ukawhisisa tjimwe netjimwe.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Alakana Yesu Khirisitu, weludzi gwaDavida, kakale wakamuka kubafi sekwakunosumikigwa mundebo mbuya yangu, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />ndebo mbuya yandinodziyilila kakale yandakasungigwa nemiketane sembobola mbi. Koga dama leNdzimu alizosungiwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Ndizo ke ndodzikitidza muzwinhu zose ndiyetila bakahalugwa, kuyetila kuti nayibo bo bawane tjidziwa muna Khirisitu Yesu iko kunohhisa gudzo lisingapele. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Iyeyi ndebo inogalikabgwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Hapa takafa naye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">towhotjila naye.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Hapa tidzikitidza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">towhotonga bo naye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Hapa tiwunlandula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">iye bo unowhotilandula.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Hapa iswi tisingagalikemoyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">iye unogala egalikamoyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">ngobe iye atotubula zwilandula.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">N'hingi Unowamutjilika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Ubakumbudze ikoku, ubatjemele mbeli kweNdzimu, kuti baletjedze kakabadzana nekwematama ngobe akuna tjakunobhatsha, koga kopaladza ibabo banowha. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Uzwipile nemasimba awo wose kuti uzwilakidze kuNdzimu sewakawamutjigwa, n'hingi usina honi nen'hingo uwe, unobhata zwibuyanana dama lemalebeswa. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Galila kule nelebeleka kusinajidzo kuna hambgwa, ngobe koyeta banhu bakahhala sahla Ndzimu. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Kakale zwilebo zwabo zopembela selonda lisingalapike. Bamwe babo ndiHhemenasi naFiletasi, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />bakathewuka mulebeswa bakabhatilila mundebo inoti muka kubafi kwakatjiyetika. Banotjinya galamoyo kwebamwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Koga mbviwa yeNdzimu yakasima ayitotsheduka, payili kwakakwagwa kuti, “He unoziba banhu babe,” nekuti “Wose unodana zina laHe wakafanila siyana nekusalulama.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Mun'umba yemfumi akuna zwidla zwezeezi nezwidla zwesiliva koga, koga kuna zwidla zwekuni, nezwimwe zwakabumbiwa nentapwe, nezwimwe zwinohingisiwa hapa kuna n'hingo unatjilemela, nezwimwe zwinohinga mahhuba ose kusina n'hingo unatjilemela. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Hapa nhu ezwitjenesa muzwinhu zwisina tjilemela unowhobe tjidla tjinohingisiwa hapa kulin'hingo unatjilemela, tjidla tjakatjena tjinobhatsha kumweni wenzi, tjakalulamila kene upi n'hingo wakanaka. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Ndizo ke siyana nenjemulo mbi dzebuhhuhha unange kululama, bugalimoyo, ludo, nekunyalala panhu pan'ompela nebanonamata He ngemoyo wakatjena. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Iba kule nekakabadzana kwebulengwe kusina nkumbulo, ngobe noziba kuti komusa hhoba. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Nlanda waHe azofanila kuti abenhu wehhoba koga abenhu unabunhu kunhu wose, unotubula diya kakale abe nemoyo nlefu, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />etambunudza bose banoleyana naye ngekutebama. Pamwe swiyo Ndzimu engabapa nkoba kuti bahanduke batubule ziba lebeswa, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />kakale kuti baswike pawhisisa bapudzumuke mudati laSatane, hule kwekuti abatola kuti anobayetisa kuda kukwe.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Mahhuba Ebupelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Koga ukuwhisise kuti mumahhuba ebupelo kowhohha lubaka gunolema. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Ngobe banhu banowhoba nekuzwida, banoda mari kwazo, banozwibudza, banozwikudza, bonolebeleka nebamwe nezila yakayipa, basingawhilile bazwadzi babo, basingaboke, basakayengemala, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />basina ludo nebam'we, basina mazwibhatigwa kubam'we, banogala benyeya, basina mazibhato, banohlisa, banobenga tjakanaka, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />batengesi, bahhele busada, banozwibudza kwazo, banoda zwihanhisa kupinda da Ndzimu. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Banoyedzelelela kuhhe sebanonamata, koga beleyana nemasimba ako. Thubukana nebanhu bakajali. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Bamwe babo banongina mumizi yebanhu betola bakadzi basakazwibhata banokuligwa nematjinyo belawugwa nenjemulo mbi dzakasiyana siyana, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />bakadzi ibabo banogala bediyiwa koga besingaswike pakuziba lebeswa. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />SaJanisi naJamburesi baka kakabadzana naMozisi, balume ibaba bo banoleyana nemalebeswa, banhu banamikumbulo isingahinge, basina bhatsho hapa kwakalingisana nekwebugalimoyo. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Koga abangaswike kule, ngobe bulengwe gwabo gowhobhuda patjena kunhu wose sekwakayetika kuna Janisi naJamburesi.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Layiwa Kwebupelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Iwe wakatobela diya kwangu, nezwibhata kwangu, netjinangwa tjangu mubutjilo, negalamoyo kwangu, nemoyonlefu wangu, neludo gwangu, nesimidzila kwangu, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14-52">Mih 13.14-52</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:1-20">14.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 16:1-5">16.1-5</ref>.</char></note> nedziyidziwa kwangu, nedziyila kwangu, noziba zwakandiwila ndili kuAntiyoku, kuIkhoniyamu, nekuLisitira, dziyidziwa kwakayetika kundili! Koga muna iko kose He bakandiwangula. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Lebeswa bose banoyemula kuti batjile butjilo gwehla Ndzimu muna Khirisitu Yesu banowhodziyidziwa, <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />nebanhu bakayipa nebatjengeli banowhoyendilambeli mububi, betjebela kakale betjebegwa bo. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Koga iwe yendilambeli uli muna kwawakadiyika, kakale ukakugalamoyo, noziba kuti wakakudiyiwa naboyani, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />nekuti kubvisila mubutjetjana gugo wakaziba whalo dzakayengemala dzinotubula kudiya butjenjebvu gunotungamila kutjidziwa ngebugalimoyo muna Khirisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Gumwe negumwe lukwalo gwakafemegwa neNdzimu kakale gobhatsha pakudiya, pakutjemela, pakutambunudza, kakale nepadiya lulama <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />kuti nhu weNdzimu abe wakapelela, akazwilulamisila umwe newumwe n'hingo wakanaka.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Ndokulaya mbeli kweNdzimu nambeli kwaKhirisitu Yesu iye unowhotonga bapenyu nebafi, neboneka kukwe nangebumambo gugwe, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />ululamile sumikila dama, mulubaka gwakafanila nemulubaka gusakafanila, utambunudze, utjemele, ukuludzile, udiye nemoyo nlefu. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Ngobe lubaka gowhohha banhu pabasingowhoda zwidiyo zwemalebeswa, koga nentha yekuti banoba benazebe dzinoda wha banowhozwikubunganyila badiyi banodiya kwabanohaka wha. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Banowhothewuka besiya whilila malebeswa bedzibayila bengina mungano dzisina malebeswa. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Koga iwe iba nenkumbulo wakabulungika lubaka gose, usimidzile mudziyila, uthame n'hingo wemvangeli, uhhadzise dan'wa kuko.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Ngobe imi bupenyu gwangu gwedululigwa sempilo unon'wiwa; lubaka gwangu gwekuti nditjibva muhango gobva gusedzela. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Ndagwa gwa kwakanaka, ndapedza ndima yangu, ndakatjengeta bugalimoyo. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Ngwenuwali ndatjitjengetegwa tjiyala tjekululama, tjandinowhopiwa naHe iye ntongi wakalulama muHhuba ilelo, kusi imi ndoga koga nabo bose bakalindila neludo bonekwa kukwe.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matama Akanangana naPhawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Gwisa kwazo kuti uhhe kundili nekulibilidza. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Ngobe Demasi ngentha yeda hango ino wakanditihha akayenda kuThesalonika. Khiresenzi wakayenda kuGalathiya, Thayithasi wakayenda kuDalamatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka yega ndiye ugele nemi. Utole Mako ubuye naye, ngobe unondibhatsha kwazo mun'hingo. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Thikhikhasi ndakawuntuma kuEfesu. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Hapa wohha undibhatile tjiyambalo tjandakasiya kunaKhaphasi kuThirowasi, uhhe kose newhalo bukulu idzedziya dzakakwagwa mumakukuta.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Elekizanda mpfuli wedzitshipi wakandikubadza kwazo, He banowhowunthama sekwaakandithama. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Uwutjenjelele ngobe waka enyanyayidza kwazo zwidiyo zwedu.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Pandakandizwimila kwekutanga akuna wakama nemi, banhu bose, bakandifupatila. Kadzene bangasabonw'a nlandu. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Koga He bakama nemi bakandipa masimba ekuti ndisumikile ndebo nekuhhele, kuyetila kuti bataya bose bawhe. Nekwakajalo ke ndakabvubugwa kubva munlomo wehumba. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Ndowhowanguligwa naHe kubva muzwinhu zose zwakayipa bekanditjengeta beyetila bumambo gwabo gwekudzimu. Ngakudziwe He nekusingapele. Akujalo.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buyisa Kwebupelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Ubuyise Phurisila naAkhwila, nebenzi waOnesiforasi. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erasitasi wakasala kuKhorinte, Thirofimasi ndakawunsiya kuMilethasi ngobe waka egwala. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Uyedze nemasimba awo wose kuti uhhe kusanhu kukaba lubaka gwembaba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Yubhulusi naPhudenesi, naLinasi, naKilawudiyasi nehama dzose banokulezwa.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />He babe nemeya iyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Ngoni ngadzibe namwi.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>